n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\"><code>std.mem.Allocator</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.getSdk\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.getSdk</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L38\">Source line 38</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Detect SDK on Darwin.\nCalls <code>xcrun --sdk &lt;target_sdk&gt; --show-sdk-path</code> which fetches the path to the SDK.\nCaller owns the memory.\nstderr from xcrun is ignored.\nIf error.OutOfMemory occurs in Allocator, this function returns null.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">getSdk</span>(gpa: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\">Allocator</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>, target: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Target/#std.Target\">Target</a>) ?[]<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>gpa: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\">Allocator</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>target: *<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Target/#std.Target\">Target</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.Io\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.Io</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L2\">Source line 2</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Io/#std.Io\"><code>std.Io</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.isSdkInstalled\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.isSdkInstalled</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L19\">Source line 19</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Check if SDK is installed on Darwin without triggering CLT installation popup window.</p>\n<p>Simply invoking <code>xcrun</code> will inevitably trigger the CLT installation popup.\nTherefore, we resort to invoking <code>xcode-select --print-path</code> and checking\nif the status is nonzero.</p>\n<p>stderr from xcode-select is ignored.</p>\n<p>If error.OutOfMemory occurs in Allocator, this function returns null.</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">isSdkInstalled</span>(gpa: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\">Allocator</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>) <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>gpa: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\">Allocator</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.macos\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.macos</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L8\">Source line 8</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/zig/system/darwin/macos/#std.zig.system.darwin.macos\"><code>std.zig.system.darwin.macos</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.mem\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.mem</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L3\">Source line 3</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/mem/#std.mem\"><code>std.mem</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.zig.system.darwin.std\"><h3><code>std.zig.system.darwin.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-ki